{% import "_common.j2" as c %}
{% macro body(b) -%}
{% if b.reason == "no_matter" %}I couldn't find a matter number in your email. UARB matter numbers are an M followed by five digits, like {{ b.example }}. Which matter should I look up, and which documents do you want: {{ b.types }}?
{%- elif b.reason == "invalid_matter_like" %}That number doesn't look like a UARB matter number. They are an M followed by five digits, like {{ b.example }}. Could you check it and reply with the full number?
{%- elif b.reason == "unknown_type" %}I wasn't sure which documents you wanted. Reply with one of {{ b.types }}, and I'll send up to {{ b.batch }} of them as a ZIP.
{%- else %}{{ b.question }}
{%- endif %}
{%- endmacro %}

{% macro text(b) %}
{% if b.p %}
{{ c.about(b.p) }}

{% endif %}
{{ body(b) }}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro html(b) %}
{% if b.p %}
<p>{{ c.about(b.p) }}</p>
{% endif %}
<p>{{ body(b) }}</p>
{% endmacro %}
